DESCRIPTION:Robert Mac was the grand-prize winner of Comedy Central’s nat
 ional stand-up competition and has appeared on Last Comic Standing\, The Le
 arning Channel\, Comedy Central\, and many shows that have since gone off t
 he air. He’s performed at the prestigious Just For Laughs comedy festival
  in Montreal\, the San Francisco Comedy Competition\, and the Boston Comedy
  Festival\, to name a few.\n\nHis first Dry Bar Comedy special (Know More R
 obert Mac) was so successful that they asked him to perform a second (Back 
 to Lake Titicaca).\n\nHis act is smart\, delightful\, and original. If you 
 prefer brainy\, dead-pan comedy over brain-dead\, pandering comedy\, check 
 him out.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/robert-mac-
 23506/
